
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Squishy World 🍏</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f8fff0;
  color: #294b32;
}
header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#d9f7a8,#9bd17b);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 45px 15px;
}
header h1 {
  font-size: 45px;
  margin: 10px;
}
nav {
  background: #eff9df;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}
nav a {
  color: #477b3e;
  margin: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}
main {
  max-width: 950px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 20px;
}
h2 { color: #477b3e; }
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));
  gap: 15px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #e0efce;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}
.card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 160px;
  object-fit: contain;
  border-radius: 15px;
  background: #effbdc;
}
footer {
  background: #d9f1bd;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>🍏 Squishy World 💚</h1>
  <p>¡NeeDohs, dumplings y squishies virales!</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#needoh">NeeDoh</a>
  <a href="#dumplings">Dumplings</a>
  <a href="#virales">Virales</a>
</nav>

<main>

<section id="needoh">
<h2>🟢 NeeDohs</h2>
<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<img src="https://schylling.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/ND-NiceCube-Blue-1.jpg" alt="Nice Cube">
<h3>Nice Cube</h3>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://schylling.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/ND-Gumdrop-1.jpg" alt="Gumdrop">
<h3>Gumdrop</h3>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="dumplings">
<h2>🥟 Dumpling Squishies</h2>
<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<img src="https://squishy-dumpling.com/cdn/shop/files/dumpling-squishy-colors.jpg" alt="Dumpling">
<h3>Dumpling Squishy</h3>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://squishy-dumpling.com/cdn/shop/files/dumpling-squishy-colors-2.jpg" alt="Dumpling kawaii">
<h3>Kawaii Dumpling</h3>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="virales">
<h2>⭐ Squishies virales</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<img src="https://schylling.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/ND-NiceCube-Swirl-1.jpg" alt="Squishy colorido">
<h3>Colorful Squishy</h3>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
💚 Squishy World · ¡Un mundo blandito! 🍏
</footer>

</body>
</html>
